      "content": "thanks, that helps. so if a student is playing the role of a proponent in the debate, they wouldn't just say it was \"flawed science\"—they would have argued it was sound science. \n\nto make the debate realistic, can you outline how they would have presented the \"logical\" connection between those biological claims and the need for economic or social stability? like, how did they link the idea of racial hierarchy to the argument that segregation was actually better for the functioning of society as a whole?",
